  <entity00266961:DisclosureOfIndirectMeasurementOfFairValueOfGoodsOrServicesReceivedCashSettledStockOptionsGrantedDuringPeriodTextBlock contextRef="CFY2024dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember" xml:lang="ko">(다) 연결회사는 주식선택권의 보상원가를 이항모형 및 몬테카를로 시뮬레이션 (Monte-Carlo)을 이용한 공정가치접근법을 적용하여 산정하였으며, 보상원가를 산정하기위한 당기말 현재 제반 가정 및 변수는 다음과 같습니다.</entity00266961:DisclosureOfIndirectMeasurementOfFairValueOfGoodsOrServicesReceivedCashSettledStockOptionsGrantedDuringPeriodTextBlock>
  <ifrs-full:InformationAboutHowFairValueWasMeasuredShareOptionsGranted contextRef="CFY2024dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementsAxis_entity00266961_GrantedOn20240510StockSettlementMemberOfWebtoonEntertainmentIncMemberOfDisclosureOfIndirectMeasurementOfFairValueOfGoodsOrServicesReceivedShareOptionsGrantedDuringPeriodTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">이항모형 및 LSMC(LeastSquareMonte-Carlo) 등을 이용한 공정가치접근법</ifrs-full:InformationAboutHowFairValueWasMeasuredShareOptionsGranted>
